const privacy = `${pageIntro('Privacy','Your enquiry.<br><em>Your information.</em>','How information is handled on this website.')}<section class="section"><div class="container prose"><h2>Enquiries</h2><p>The enquiry form prepares a draft in your browser. It does not send your details to a server or save them to browser storage. When you choose “Open email draft”, your email application receives the draft. You decide whether to send it.</p><p>If you send an email or message, or call us, the company receives the information you share to discuss your requirements and respond to your enquiry.</p><h2>Website features</h2><p>This version of the website uses no analytics scripts, advertising cookies or third-party embedded maps. Fonts and photographs are served with the website. Hosting services may process ordinary connection information necessary to deliver pages.</p><h2>External links and downloads</h2><p>Map, social and WhatsApp links open external services, which handle information under their own policies. Company profiles are supplied as PDF downloads; they may include business contacts and company information.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For questions about information you have shared with Clement Projects Solution, email <a href="mailto:info@clementprojectssolution.co.za">info@clementprojectssolution.co.za</a> or call <a href="tel:+27150041433">015 004 1433</a>.</p></div></section>`;
writeFileSync(`${out}/privacy.html`, layout('Privacy', 'How the Clement Projects Solution website handles enquiry drafts and contact information.', privacy, ''));
